        <h2>A poet and book lover<br>from the North West</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">I'm Ellie, a creative writer and poet living in Manchester. Words are both my day job and my favourite way to waste an evening.</p>
        <p>Blue Orangutan Tales is named after the blue orangutan bookmark that lives in whatever I happen to be reading. He has seen me through hundreds of books, and now he lends his name to the place where I write about them.</p>
        <p>The North West has a long line of poets and storytellers who write plainly and feel deeply, and that is the tradition I want to write in. On this site you will find my book reviews, my poems and occasional notes on the Manchester and wider North West writing scene.</p>
        <p>If you would like to keep up between posts, Instagram is where everything appears first.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-blue" href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow @blueorangutantales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
