<section class="cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>What you will find here</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Book reviews.</strong> Honest thoughts on literary fiction, poetry collections and whatever else makes it to the top of the pile. If I loved it, I will say so. If I did not, I will say that too, kindly.</p>
        <p><strong>Poems.</strong> Original poetry of my own, published here as each piece is finished.</p>
        <p><strong>Tales.</strong> Notes from a reading and writing life in the North West: libraries, bookshops, open mic nights and the occasional rained-off festival.</p>
      </div>
